<title>USA: FSA qualifies three muni issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies three muni issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said it has qualified for bond insurance the following three municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Cypress Forest PUD, Texas, $2.655 million waterworks and sewer system revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Richland County School District No 2, S.C., $5.315 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Keller, Texas, $1.175 million revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
